        <path class="opacity-75" fill="currentColor" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8v8H4z"></path>
      </svg><span>Calculando cotización...</span>
    </button><!-- Botón Secundario: Limpiar formulario --><button type="button" disabled="" class="py-3 px-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 active:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-semibold text-sm transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
